OL,3,ALyon tourism office set on fire as more
OL,4,Athan 160 arrested on major day of
OL,5,Aprotests across France
OL,6,
OL,7,FA tourism office has been set on fire
OL,8,Fin Lyon as France grapples with a day
OL,9,Fof major protests over falling
OL,10,Feducation standards and the cost of
OL,11,Fliving
OL,13,FMore than 160 people have been arrested
OL,14,Facross the country, with a large-scale
OL,15,Fdemonstration under way in Paris - you
OL,16,Fcan watch live above
OL,18,FThe French interior ministry condemns
OL,19,Fwhat it calls "targeted acts of
OL,20,Fviolence" and accuses some protesters
OL,21,Fof attempts at looting and attacks on
OL,22,Fpolice
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
