OL,3,ALyon tourism office set on fire as more
OL,4,Athan 160 arrested on major day of
OL,5,Aprotests across France
OL,6,
OL,7,FA group of protesters briefly broke
OL,8,Finto Marseille City Hall before being
OL,9,Fforced out by police, while officers
OL,10,Ffired tear gas at demonstrators in
OL,11,FParis, Bordeaux and Lyon
OL,13,FOn the ground, a group of young people
OL,14,Ftells our correspondent they are
OL,15,F"pacifists" who are "just trying to
OL,16,Fmake things change"
OL,18,FIt follows three weeks of student-led
OL,19,Fprotests across the country, with calls
OL,20,Ffor students to be joined by workers'
OL,21,Funions and key figures from the
OL,22,Fso-called "yellow vest" movement
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
